    "detailed_description": "<i>Do you have the guts to rule an entire <strong>Pingdom</strong>? Get your Penguins to gather<strong> resources </strong>to either <strong>build</strong> up a strong <strong>defence</strong> for the incoming waves of <strong>enemies</strong>, or to <strong>upgrade</strong> and <strong>unlock</strong> new structures. Use the space efficiently as your island <strong>expands</strong>.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Penguins Of Different Species</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759110/extras/d4b9e1f1b0cea1b800a9fbdba9f49a3c.avif?t=1717890818\" width=590 height=214 /></span><br><br>Send out your curious Penguins on <strong>adventures</strong> to find DNA structures to bring new <strong>species</strong> to life. Different species have different <strong>perks</strong>, therefore they are good at different things. (Some are good at mining while others are good crafters)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand Your Island With Biomes</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759110/extras/09141b46e5c9009abe889f6f9ac5af6b.avif?t=1717890818\" width=590 height=214 /></span><br><br>Defeat <strong>waves</strong> of enemies and bosses not just to survive but also to get <strong>rewards</strong> as an <strong>Island Upgrade</strong>.<br>Island Upgrades is used to <strong>expand</strong> your island to gain more <strong>resources</strong> and land to build on. So use your resources efficiently so you dont run out. Different Island Upgrades have different <strong>biomes</strong> as Forest, Deep Forest, Lake, Mountains and Icy Mountains.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend Your Pingdom From The Evil Forces Of Turtles</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759110/extras/cd3b5f00fd7e5967653dcdd306fd297f.avif?t=1717890818\" width=590 height=214 /></span><br><br><strong>Enemy</strong> spawns are random every wave but the difficulty increases each time. Every fifth wave one of all <strong>Bosses</strong> will appear, after defeat it will give you great <strong>rewards</strong>. Different bosses have unique attack <strong>abilities</strong>.",
